        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mortise Deadlatch Conversion Kit</b>\r\n<p>\r\nKit to convert  doors from a <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a>  to a Deadlatch with Push / Pull Paddle Handle. Paddle is 4-way reversible. Handing can easily be reversed on cam plug by removing C-clip and flipping the cam over and reinstaling C-clip.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIf you need a new Lock Cylinder use \r\n <a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-conversion-kit-with-lock-cylinder-th1103-pbsc\"><b>Conversion Kit with Lock Cylinder</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/high-security-storefront-door-mortise-deadlatch-lock-sets-mul-t-lock-cylinders-th1103-pm\"><b>Conversion Kit with High Security Lock</b></a> \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Mortise Deadlatch\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handed, Field Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Face plate: 1\" width x 6-7/8\" Length - Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: 7/8\" width x 6\" Lenth, Depth specific to backset (1.63\" - 1.78\").</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" width x 1.0\" length x 1/2\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TH1103.pdf?v=1704262220\" target=\"new\"\"><b>Global TH1103 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p> \r\n<b>Package Includes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-deadlatch-push-pull-handle-th1100-push\">Push / Pull Handle</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\">Mortise Deadlatch Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-faceplate-th1100-fp11-15\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-single-strike-assembly-th1100-st2\">Strike Plate Assembly</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for trim. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Exit Devise is available in Aluminum or Duronotic (Dark Bronze) finish. Outside trim is always Aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this exit device: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
